{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/grove-emaar-properties-dubai-creek-harbour","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":295,"crm_id":"2429","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Grove","slug":"grove-emaar-properties-dubai-creek-harbour","display_address":"Dubai Creek Harbour","building_type":["apartment","penthouse"],"completion_year":"2025","developer":"Emaar Properties","price":2508888,"display_price":"2.508M","lattitude":25.1221434,"longitude":55.2146239,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Grove is a unique luxury residential complex designed by Emaar, one of the most prestigious developers. This amazing project includes four towers, each of which has a unique look, height from 9 to 11 floors and harmoniously fits into the picturesque landscape of Dubai Creek Harbour. The project offers a wide range of apartments, which are characterized by their comfort and functionality. The choice of layouts includes <strong>one, two and three bedroom</strong> residences with beautiful views of the courtyard and green spaces, as well as luxurious <strong>four-bedroom penthouses</strong> offering amazing direct views of the canal waterfront.</p><p>Residents are uniquely positioned to enjoy a variety of benefits and amenities that include a wave pool, an expansive Central Park that is the perfect place to relax and stroll. Equally attractive is the picturesque waterfront, which offers the opportunity to enjoy views of the waterways. There is also a Splash Pad area with water rides and a playground for the little ones and their parents. For adults, there is a lounge area near the bar area.</p><p>The location of Grove Towers allows residents of the complex to quickly get to the sights of Dubai. In six to seven minutes you can reach Al Khail Road, which provides convenient transportation access. The unique Ras Al Khor Wildlife Sanctuary is just 15 minutes away, Palm Jumeirah Beach and Dubai Marina are a 20-30 minute drive, and Dubai International Airport is approximately 12 minutes away.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2429/images/2024/07/04/IHcr3ig2o0hxGhlcd9vLVsUWT6SZQG7N0nBuwJ70.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/04/IHcr3ig2o0hxGhlcd9vLVsUWT6SZQG7N0nBuwJ70.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2429/images/2024/07/04/W4ZAWrNuXI3KiRgz3BElLdBjIOI6D9PDvRJe7MSv.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/04/W4ZAWrNuXI3KiRgz3BElLdBjIOI6D9PDvRJe7MSv.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2429/images/2024/07/04/y1vn5ADlKYrjBvJ9LbTz6lA2WrN7eWZLTVgYK66H.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/04/y1vn5ADlKYrjBvJ9LbTz6lA2WrN7eWZLTVgYK66H.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2382,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1620,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1724,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1725,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1726,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"3 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1727,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"4 Bedroom Penthouse","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"80/20","payment_plans":[{"id":7444